source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "nested2_subcommand_help(\"memory\", \"bisect\", \"run\")"
---
Run SCRIPT once with `sh -c` and mark good on exit 0, bad otherwise.

Requires a bisect in progress.

Usage: run <SCRIPT>

Arguments:
  <SCRIPT>
          Shell command string, passed to `sh -c`

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
